<title>GERMANY: Linde 4-month incoming orders up 12 pct.</title>
<headline>Linde 4-month incoming orders up 12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to April 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		    3,143   up 12 pct</p>
<p>	 of which</p>
<p>	Plant construction		     537.5   up 21.1 pct</p>
<p>	Hydraulics				 1,341   up 9.5 pct</p>
<p>	Refrigeration technology	     347.8   up 12.8 pct</p>
<p>    Group sales				  2,749   up 6.4 pct</p>
<p>	 of which</p>
<p>	Plant construction		     273.9   up 27 pct</p>
<p>	Hydraulics				 1,280   up 0.5 pct</p>
<p>	Refrigeration technology	     277.7   up 9.5 pct</p>
<p>	Technical gases			  915.3   up 8.5 pct</p>
<p>    Group orders in hand		     6,634   up 5.3 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German engineering group is Linde AG.</p>
</text>
